      "writtenOn": "2026-09-09T07:04:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The componentInfoMap update and the image-set-level entry now happen after the loop, so an early return would drop the components already parsed successfully. break stops the parse (the pointer arithmetic isn\u0027t trustworthy after a failed decode) while keeping the partial results.",
