      "writtenOn": "2026-09-09T07:04:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, and it still is. createFirmwareEntry() is an upsert keyed on SoftwareIdentifier, so on the re-query path each entry is refreshed with the newly decoded version. This patch only changes whether the redundant image-level object is created, not whether versions get published.",
